{"title":"악역과 부모가 바뀌었다 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"이세계에 환생했다.그러나 하필이면 19금 피폐물 소설 『검은 머리 치료사』 속 세계.그것도 장애를 입은 악역의 '동생 대역'을 하다가, 결국 처형당하는 조연이었다.이 사실을 깨달은 슈슈는 엄마와 함께 북부로 도망친다.하지만 원작을 비틀 수 없었던 일곱 살의 슈슈는 결국 데미안 베스페르의 대역이 되고.......어떻게 해서든 정체를 들키지 않으려 했지만“벗어.”스무살의 슈슈를,악역의 형 칼릭스 베스페르가 의심하기 시작했다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-11-10","rank":70,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-11","rank":56,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-11-12","rank":40,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":58,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-11-19","rank":235,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-20","rank":207,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-11-10","rank":233,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-11","rank":139,"change":{"type":"up","amount":94}},{"date":"2026-11-12","rank":79,"change":{"type":"up","amount":60}},{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":62,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":61,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":68,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":61,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-11-17","rank":76,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":95,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-11-19","rank":174,"change":{"type":"down","amount":79}},{"date":"2026-11-20","rank":287,"change":{"type":"down","amount":113}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":278,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":269,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":268,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":242,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-11-17","rank":240,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-11-18","rank":227,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-11-19","rank":231,"change":{